{
  "id": "section-819",
  "title": "关于打人问题",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-199.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>199)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　党的政策不主张打人。但打人也要进行阶级分析，好人打坏人活该；坏人打好人，好人光荣；好人打好人误会。今后再不许打人。要摆事实讲道理。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-198.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-200.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
